<title>USA: Cutter &amp; Buck to offer 1.4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Cutter &amp; Buck to offer 1.4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cutter &amp; Buck Inc Thursday said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed offering of 1,400,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of the shares being offered, 1,300,000 will be sold by the company and up to 100,000 shares will be sold by a group of Selling Shareholders. Proceeds of the offering will be used for working capital purposes, including repayment of all outstanding balances under the company's revolving line of credit and increases in inventory and trade expenses.</p>
</text>
